{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gupA5RSurI1794563610.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產上水中心第一分行首席分區營業經理楊浩鴻表示，近日整體入市氣氛向好，上水名都最新錄本月首宗成交，單位為1座中層B室，單位實用面積391平方呎，屬2房間隔，由於放盤價錢屬屋苑入場價，隨即吸引6至7組客人同時遠價，最終以380萬元易手，實用面積平均呎價9,719元。<br/>中原楊浩鴻指，新買家為上車客，見屋苑位置方便，單位價錢吸引，即購入單位自用。據了解，原業主則於1997年以236萬元購入上址，持貨約29年，現轉手賬面獲利144萬元離場，單位期內升值61%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.388033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:07:24.104402+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:19.599509+00:00","content_hash":"b64c69ed981f106723f378dc1624ddc92fc12d17c0ff3a5fa26c8adfc4a5c70a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.388033+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}